You're not sure to get either.  Unless you wish for artifacts,
you're sure not to get the first, for many characters, and all
too often, by the time you get the first wish, you've already
seen enough artifacts to make wishing for them ineffective.
(Otherwise, I'd have Magicbane for all of my ascension runs.) As
for the cloak, it's a good alternative if you get it, but
generally I'll prefer a robe, and better spell casting.  (Cure
sickness at 0%, for example, is very useful when you take on
Pestilance.  Magic missle is nice against mind flayers on watery
levels.  Etc.)

